      "date": "2026-10-17",
      "fact": "Homes with bin storage should have a green-top general waste bin, a blue-top recycling bin and a black or grey glass box. Homes without storage get rolls of sacks delivered twice a year. Before reporting a missing bin residents are asked to check whether it was moved, claimed by a neighbour or returned to the wrong property.",
      "fact_key": "2081dc866c06",
