      "topic": "Bin types and checks",
      "url": "https://www.southampton.gov.uk/bins-recycling/bins/lost-bin/"
    },
    {
      "caveat": "The page does not say whether damaged bins are free.",
      "date": "2026-10-17",
      "fact": "A lost or stolen general waste (green-lidded) bin costs 33 pounds for 140 litre, 43 pounds for 240 litre and 54 pounds for 360 litre. Charges are non-refundable. Glass and recycling bins can be replaced free.",
      "fact_key": "b8a7204ac23a",
